  "faq": {
    "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "description": "Find answers to common questions about Reactify Cheque Printer System.",
    "q1": "What banks are supported?",
    "a1": "We support all major Nepalese banks including Nabil Bank, Global IME Bank, Siddhartha Bank, NIC Asia, Prabhu Bank, and many more. We're constantly adding new bank templates.",
    "q2": "How accurate is the cheque printing?",
    "a2": "Our templates are precisely calibrated to ensure accurate alignment. We test each template thoroughly to match the exact cheque dimensions of each bank.",
    "q3": "Is there a free trial?",
    "a3": "Yes! We offer a 14-day free trial with 10 cheque prints. No credit card required. You can upgrade to a paid plan at any time.",
    "q4": "Can I print cheques in bulk?",
    "a4": "Yes, our Business plan includes bulk printing features, allowing you to print multiple cheques at once. This is perfect for businesses with high-volume payment needs.",
    "q5": "Is my data secure?",
    "a5": "Absolutely. We use industry-standard encryption to protect your data. Your cheque information is stored securely and is never shared with third parties.",
    "q6": "How do I get support?",
    "a6": "We offer email support for all plans, with priority support for Business plan users. You can reach us at support@reactifysoftwaretechnologies.com.np."
  },
